WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.870
What in the world just happened?

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:08.269
Did we actually just witness Imu wiping an
entire island off the face of the earth with

00:00:08.269 --> 00:00:10.450
nothing but a pen-stroke?

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:16.420
This panel of a gigantic sphere crushing the
island of Lulusia Kingdom into the ocean,

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:23.790
not leaving behind any trace of it, is easily
one of the most ominous panels I have ever

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.120
seen in the story.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:30.900
It's right up there with the likes of Zunesha's
first appearance or Kaido's or the giant Shadows

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.390
in the florin triangle.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:37.910
But as if that weren't enough already, Eiichiro
Oda once again dropped a bomb shell, having

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:44.050
him reveal his true dream to the straw hats
and in extension to Caribou, who is stored

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:49.489
away in a barrel on the ship, that people
speculated might contain carrot.

00:00:49.489 --> 00:00:54.579
Who knows maybe carrot is stored inside caribou
who is stored inside the barrel.

00:00:54.579 --> 00:00:56.530
Like the Russian nesting dolls.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.149
It looks like the crew will be spending a
lot of time with Jewlery Bonney, who is one

00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:06.170
of the characters I have been most excited
about to get screen time and it looks like

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:11.430
we are about to arrive at the next island,
which seems to be neither sphinx island nor

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:14.470
elbaf, but a mysterious winter island.

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:20.940
Once again a classic move by Oda-sensei, going
some place none of us could have anticipated.

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:27.620
And I think it's so awesome to finally go
back to a winter island after all this time.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:33.350
I guess Punk hazard sort of counts, but with
it's artificially changed climate that was

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:40.260
half lava and half snow and Caesars experiments
on it, it didn't quite have the same snowy

00:01:40.260 --> 00:02:33.650
vibe as Chopper's home country on Drum Island.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:37.730
But before we get to the straw hats and all
the great and exciting stuff that's going

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:44.569
on with them, I simply have to begin with
Sabo's storyline, because holy usopp.

00:02:44.569 --> 00:02:49.330
So as you'll remember, Sabo had called the
headquarters of the revolutionary army on

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:53.370
Kamabakka Island to inform them about what
happened to them.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:59.420
And we see the entire upper echelon of the
revolutionary army assembled to listen what

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:05.140
he has to report, including Luffy's father
Monkey D. Dragon, the four commanders, Ivankov,

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.230
hack and Koala.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:13.110
To get it out of the way, Sabo clarifies,
what you and me already knew, that he wasn't

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:17.110
the one that assassinated king cobra of alabasta,
Vivi's father.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:23.400
What I found notable here, is that there is
no sign that Vivi is with Sabo right now,

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.530
which I personally would have expected.

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:28.959
It looks like the princess is one her own
somewhere.

00:03:28.959 --> 00:03:36.180
Sabo however quickly moves on to the next,
much more important point: He mentions the

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:42.290
empty throne inside Panega Castle in Marijois,
but before he is able to finish what exactly

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:47.230
he saw in that throne room, he is apparently
cut off.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:51.540
Because while Sabo is on the phone with the
revolutionaries, the marines have been listening

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.540
in.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:57.201
Sabo had apparently been in such a hurry to
share his news, that he wasn't able to wait

00:03:57.201 --> 00:04:02.160
to get a secure white den den mushi, that
can't be listened in on.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:08.129
Either that, or Sabo actively WANTED to be
overheard by the Marines, so they would find

00:04:08.129 --> 00:04:13.980
out the truth about the government, that even
they don't know: That there is a true ruler

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.739
of the world, that sits on the empty throne.

00:04:16.739 --> 00:04:17.739
Imu.

00:04:17.739 --> 00:04:22.030
The marines have successfully managed to track
Sabo's location to the island of Lulusia.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:25.639
You might remember this island from not too
long ago.

00:04:25.639 --> 00:04:30.139
It was the place where we first got introduced
to the revolutionary commanders, who helped

00:04:30.139 --> 00:04:37.349
the citizens there overthrow their cruel king.

00:04:37.349 --> 00:04:43.059
The Gorosei are shocked by this reveal and
actually pity Sabo.

00:04:43.059 --> 00:04:44.059
Why?

00:04:44.059 --> 00:04:48.189
Remember how the Gorosei talked to Imu about
a great cleansing and a light being extinguished

00:04:48.189 --> 00:04:49.460
from the world.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:56.289
Well it turns out that Imu had decided that
exactly this island that Sabo is on, Lulusia,

00:04:56.289 --> 00:04:58.090
should be that light.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:04.210
So, at least my understanding of this situation,
is not that Imu decided to destroy this place

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:07.550
to keep Sabo from revealing his existence.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:14.710
Much rather it seems more of an unlucky coincidence,
that Sabo is at the wrong place at the wrong

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.710
time.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:21.110
Before sabo can reveal anything, the Gorosei
order the marine's communication team to cut

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:23.409
of their transponder snails.

00:05:23.409 --> 00:05:29.719
Imu is striking through the island on a map
and immediately, We see dark clouds gathering

00:05:29.719 --> 00:05:30.719
over the island.

00:05:30.719 --> 00:05:38.669
A massive shadow appears, then a bright light
accompanied by Imu's frightening gaze and

00:05:38.669 --> 00:05:47.020
a giant sphere crashes into the island, obliterating
any trace, that Lulusia has ever even existed.

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:48.020
Wow.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:53.840
The way this was drawn makes it easily one
of the most brutal moments in the entire series.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:57.520
I got actual goosebumps reading it.

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:02.740
I can't even imagine how crazy this scene
will look in the anime.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:03.740
Okay, so.

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:07.229
What in the name of Usopp has happened here?

00:06:07.229 --> 00:06:12.889
What is that power that imu has used and why
did they decide to take this particular island

00:06:12.889 --> 00:06:15.679
in this fashion?

00:06:15.679 --> 00:06:19.740
The first thing that probably immediately
popped out for you as well, is that what we

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:25.830
just saw here perfectly fits the description
of what happened to the island God Valley.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:30.949
An island that simply vanished from both the
map and history.

00:06:30.949 --> 00:06:33.740
A part of the world cleansed form existence.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:39.050
If you ever needed another reason, why Laugh
tale is a hidden island with an unknown location:

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:40.679
Now you have it.

00:06:40.679 --> 00:06:46.419
If you want a safe place to store the secrets
of the world, you better make sure it can't

00:06:46.419 --> 00:06:50.400
be nuked into oblivion by the enemy.

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:54.490
As my editor also kindly reminded me, this
might actually be more evidence for the big

00:06:54.490 --> 00:07:00.849
theory that Laugh Tale either Below Ennies
Lobby or in the middle of the giant whirlpool

00:07:00.849 --> 00:07:03.779
in the middle of enies lobby, impel down and
marienford.

00:07:03.779 --> 00:07:10.169
A great way to hide and protect it from Imu
by it being directly under their noses.

00:07:10.169 --> 00:07:16.099
Or maybe they actually know about it being
there and built there best protected places

00:07:16.099 --> 00:07:19.209
around it with the gates of justice.

00:07:19.209 --> 00:07:25.249
It's also a possibility that the giant hole
under enies lobby might be connected to this

00:07:25.249 --> 00:07:28.860
crazy weapon as well.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:33.740
Maybe it struck there before or it could be
where it is hidden or stored when it's not

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:34.880
used.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:39.050
If you haven't checked out those theories,
I recommend you do after this video.

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:44.819
On a different note, it's really mean of Oda-sensei
to show us that little kid and all this innocent

00:07:44.819 --> 00:07:51.069
citizens who just regained their freedom and
peace, being all taken out in an instant.

00:07:51.069 --> 00:07:56.330
But of course it makes this moment just the
more impactful.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.740
No pun intended.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:04.979
The only possible surviver I see here is Sabo
himself, who is a logia user and I doubt that

00:08:04.979 --> 00:08:07.939
this giant thing was covered in Haki.

00:08:07.939 --> 00:08:13.069
But even then, if the entire island was destroyed
and there is only ocean left after this, he

00:08:13.069 --> 00:08:16.080
might be in a lot of trouble.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:22.169
Though I think you agreee that he will somehow
make it out of there alive.

00:08:22.169 --> 00:08:30.220
It's actually the first actively evil thing
we see Imu do, so Oda-sensei is really starting

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:35.419
to set them up as the ultimate villain of
the story.

00:08:35.419 --> 00:08:38.370
But how exactly did they do it.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:44.769
The panels here suggest, that Imu or someone
else crossing out an island on a map somehow

00:08:44.769 --> 00:08:47.300
summons this cataclysmic power.

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:50.990
But that could just be a red herring by Oda.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:55.730
It's possible that the map is simply meant
to symbolise that this island has been wiped

00:08:55.730 --> 00:09:02.630
off the face of the earth and not be related
to the power at all.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:05.980
But then again, maybe it is part of the power.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.640
But what IS it?

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:11.760
The most obvious answer here is of course
Uranus.

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:17.899
It could be that the government has gotten
their hands on one of the ancient weapons.

00:09:17.899 --> 00:09:23.709
With Pluton in Wano and Poseidon in Fishman
Island, Uranus is still unaccounted for.

00:09:23.709 --> 00:09:28.759
Plus the fact that it's supposed to be a weapon
connected to the sky that can destroy the

00:09:28.759 --> 00:09:33.420
world fits what we just saw pretty nicely.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:38.170
On the other hand, the ancient weapons were
created to oppose the government and it's

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:44.480
been heavily implied that Luffy needs all
three of them in order to change the world.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:49.649
Another possibility, that I made a video about
just a few days ago, is that this is some

00:09:49.649 --> 00:09:53.180
sort of ultimate devil fruit power, that Imu
wields.

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:57.759
It could also be some other sort of ancient
advanced technology, like a space ship.

00:09:57.759 --> 00:10:03.910
I'm probably also not the only one who remembers
the strange moon like object, that sucked

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:06.610
in capone bege's ship after the time skip
here.

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:12.699
It also is a giant sphere, thought I'm not
sure it would make sense to crash this into

00:10:12.699 --> 00:10:16.319
the ground every single time and then retrieve
it.

00:10:16.319 --> 00:10:20.841
I have a whole different theory about this
thing and how it will be important in the

00:10:20.841 --> 00:10:24.680
story soon, so make sure to subscribe if you
don't want to miss that.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:28.889
No matter what exactly this thing is, this
is the first time that we see some of the

00:10:28.889 --> 00:10:31.649
true power of the world government.

00:10:31.649 --> 00:10:38.100
Yes having the admirals is nice, but it was
always clear, that they would have much bigger

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:43.670
aces up their sleeves in order to control
the world for so long.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:49.980
I'm very curious if Imu's power simply lies
in controlling powerful weapons, or if they

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:53.649
themselves can fight as well.

00:10:53.649 --> 00:10:59.660
Just as Kaido, the previously biggest calamity
in the world, is out of the picture, Oda-sensei

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:00.660
gives us this.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.000
I love it.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:06.399
The only question is: Why this apparently
random island?

00:11:06.399 --> 00:11:11.209
Well it turns out Lulusia has been appearing
in the story a number of times.

00:11:11.209 --> 00:11:16.510
As I mentioned before, it was one of 8 countries
the revolutionary army helped to overthrow

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.899
their corrupt and cruel rulers.

00:11:18.899 --> 00:11:23.019
This by itself might already explain why Imu
decided to stomp it out.

00:11:23.019 --> 00:11:24.589
But there is more.

00:11:24.589 --> 00:11:30.209
This is the same place, that Ace visited during
his cover story, while he was hunting for

00:11:30.209 --> 00:11:31.209
Blackbeard.

00:11:31.209 --> 00:11:33.959
Very fitting that Sabo is now here as well.

00:11:33.959 --> 00:11:38.730
It's here that Ace befriended a little girl,
similar to Tama and where we get this cover

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:44.250
story of Ace looking very similar to Nika
as a silhouette.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:49.899
Someone also linked me a very interesting
theory on reddit form over a year ago, that

00:11:49.899 --> 00:11:56.019
argues that Lulusia might have been the hideout
for many of the level 6 prisoners that escaped

00:11:56.019 --> 00:11:59.449
impel down and didn't join blackbeard.

00:11:59.449 --> 00:12:05.149
Bounty hunter Jean Ango tell luffy that the
tracked down their location.

00:12:05.149 --> 00:12:09.949
The princess of the country, who doesn't exactly
get sympathy points in this chapter, is the

00:12:09.949 --> 00:12:14.639
one that was kidnapped on the way to Reverie
and later saved by Koby.

00:12:14.639 --> 00:12:20.269
In an SBS Oda-sensei revealed that this used
to be a peaceful place , similarly to what

00:12:20.269 --> 00:12:26.540
we see during ace's visit, before the new
king Seki took over who made the people suffer.

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:31.889
So it would make a lot of sense time-in wise
that after the outbreak of impel down, the

00:12:31.889 --> 00:12:36.790
level 6 prisoners came here and helped Seki
overthrow the previous king.

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:41.939
Whether or not this is true, I found this
an incredibly smart theory and it would give

00:12:41.939 --> 00:12:47.939
Imu a much bigger reason to destroy the place,
taking out a ton of super dangerous pirates

00:12:47.939 --> 00:12:49.500
and criminals, that escaped.

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:54.649
I'm really curious how Oda is going to explain
when and how Imu is able to use this weapon

00:12:54.649 --> 00:12:55.649
though.

00:12:55.649 --> 00:12:57.209
Why not use it on Ohara?

00:12:57.209 --> 00:12:58.699
Or on Wano?

00:12:58.699 --> 00:13:05.990
I guess you could argue that the marines investigated
Ohara first and that destroying Wano would

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.509
unleash Pluton.

00:13:07.509 --> 00:13:11.070
But it's still somewhat mysterious to me how
this is all working.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:12.070
But let's move on now back to the thousand
Sunny, were we follow the crews journey away

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:13.070
from Wano and towards their next destination.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:16.579
As we can see, the crew is still trying to
catch up with and process everything that

00:13:16.579 --> 00:13:18.980
has happened while they were in Wano.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:23.160
Of course, Luffy and Robin immediately throw
the idea out of he window that sabo could

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:25.029
have killed Kobra.

00:13:25.029 --> 00:13:30.279
After all Luffy knows his brother and his
dreams and Robin was staying with the revolutionaries

00:13:30.279 --> 00:13:32.600
for 2 years as well.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:37.139
I absolutely love that Luffy and the rest
of the crew is immediately willing to go back

00:13:37.139 --> 00:13:40.800
to Alabasta or Marijois itself to look for
Vivi.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:46.720
As a big Vivi fan myself, I am always happy
when she is back in focus and especially when

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.319
the crew talks about her.

00:13:48.319 --> 00:13:54.000
I'm still convinced she will come and join
up with them as their crew member, especially

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.000
now.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:59.759
She might already be on the way, who knows.

00:13:59.759 --> 00:14:04.519
Zoro is the voice of reason here, telling
Luffy that he needs to stay calm and that

00:14:04.519 --> 00:14:08.370
Vivi is strong and can look out for herself.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:13.939
Reason in air quotes, because while it's nice
that Zoro believes in Vivi I'm not sure he

00:14:13.939 --> 00:14:16.949
makes the best argument here.

00:14:16.949 --> 00:14:21.490
He reminds luffy that he trusted in ace to
solve his own problems too.

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:26.490
Only, did Zoro somehow forget how that turned
out in the end?

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:30.889
In case you need a reminder, it's with a fist
sized hole in his chest and Luffy almost losing

00:14:30.889 --> 00:14:32.559
his will to live.

00:14:32.559 --> 00:14:37.660
Soooo, not exactly the best example to bring
up here I feel.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:43.120
But I get the gist of what he's trying to
say: Since no-one knows where vivi is, no

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:46.680
point in sailing the entire grand line looking
for her.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:51.720
Rightfully however the rest of the crew teases
him for it, with some fantastic nicknames

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:56.800
including green Kaido and green big mom, which
were my highlights.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:15:00.800
Interestingly enough, Luffy doesn't want to
hear any more news.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:01.999
Understandably somewhat.

00:15:01.999 --> 00:15:04.399
There has been a lot of info dump recently.

00:15:04.399 --> 00:15:11.019
However, as a result, Robin doesn't tell Luffy
what happened on Amazon lily and that Blackbeard

00:15:11.019 --> 00:15:12.750
has taken Koby.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:18.129
I think in that case, even Zoro might have
been willing to go and safe Coby.

00:15:18.129 --> 00:15:20.850
I think it's reasonable that Robin doesn't
tell him either.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:27.810
I don't think she fully knows just how close
Koby, Zoro and Luffy were.

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:33.300
Then Luffy shares his actual dream for the
first time with his crew.

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:36.300
The only other people he told before were
ace, sabo and Shanks.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:42.319
I don't want to spend too much time on this
topic, since Oda-sensei once again only teases

00:15:42.319 --> 00:15:45.079
it here, but doesn't reveal it yet.

00:15:45.079 --> 00:15:51.529
The reactions of the crew are of course great
and fit in very well with what we saw from

00:15:51.529 --> 00:15:53.579
sabo, ace and shanks before.

00:15:53.579 --> 00:15:58.670
I personally felt part of luffy's dream was
what he shared with Kaido during the final

00:15:58.670 --> 00:15:59.670
of the battle.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:04.459
And I know the theory that Luffy simply wants
to throw the worlds biggest party.

00:16:04.459 --> 00:16:08.240
But I think it might be something even bigger.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:12.689
After all you don't necessarily have to become
pirate king for that.

00:16:12.689 --> 00:16:15.570
There is also the idea, that he wants to go
to the moon.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:19.750
Again, not exactly pirate king related at
first glance.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:23.759
So we'll just have to wait and see what it
ends up being.

00:16:23.759 --> 00:16:29.629
Now the crew knows and of course Caribou,
who it turns out has actually been on the

00:16:29.629 --> 00:16:31.360
ship with the crew, listening in.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:38.769
My first reaction to this was honestly anger:
You have some of the most advanced Haki users

00:16:38.769 --> 00:16:42.610
on the planet on this ship and no one notices
him?

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:47.529
They did notice him on fishman island and
Rayleigh was able to count the exact number

00:16:47.529 --> 00:16:49.079
of living things on an island.

00:16:49.079 --> 00:16:54.089
But suddenly Caribou can hide in a barrel
unnoticed?

00:16:54.089 --> 00:17:00.230
But then I remembered that Luffy had actually
allowed him to leave Wano on his ship in udon

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:01.230
prison.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:03.579
So maybe, they all know exactly that he's
in there.

00:17:03.579 --> 00:17:06.730
Maybe Franky locked him up a second time.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:12.069
I'm very curious to see what Oda has in mind
for Caribou and who he's working for.

00:17:12.069 --> 00:17:13.069
Blackbeard?

00:17:13.069 --> 00:17:14.069
Crocodile?

00:17:14.069 --> 00:17:15.069
Someone else?

00:17:15.069 --> 00:17:21.529
We then skip ahead a few days, as the sunny
enters the icy waters around the next island.

00:17:21.529 --> 00:17:26.130
I already mentioned that I'm incredibly excited
that we're going to an unexpected winter island

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.130
next.

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:31.980
Though I do want to mention that we haven't
been to a single autumn island yet in the

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.360
entire story.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.380
Kinda sad when you think about it.

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:37.080
But winter is awesome to.

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:38.260
It's my favorite season.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:42.990
Now even though the top two contenders for
the next island are off the table with Elbaf

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:47.950
and Sphinx island, there are actually two
possible winter islands we know of in the

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:50.950
new world, that could be where we are going
next.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:56.260
The first one is the mysterious island Drake
went to to get Kaido's attention.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:59.600
It's unnamed, but everything, including the
trees seems to be made out of metal.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:05.780
It was an island that apparently was very
important to Kaido, so it would be a fitting

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:09.390
next destination for the straw hats after
they defeated him.

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:15.640
It would surely make for some very interesting
interactions with the people there.

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:20.450
It also reminded me a lot of Karakuri Island,
Vegapunks birthplace and where Franky was

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.850
sent during the time skip.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:28.020
In the wiki it says that it is a winter island
located in paradise, but looking back through

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:31.630
the manga, I couldn't really find the section
where it stated that.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:35.010
SO maybe Karakul island is actually in the
new world.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:38.920
That of course could make it the arc where
we finally meet vegapunk.

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:40.890
Which is really overdue.

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:46.010
And then, there is also Yukiryuu island, which
means snow dragon island.

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:51.220
It's a winter island in the new world, where
shanks received the news that whitebeard tore

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.429
up his invitation.

00:18:52.429 --> 00:18:58.220
If this island is under shanks' command that
would of course also make for a fantastic

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:01.169
next destination for the crew.

00:19:01.169 --> 00:19:09.230
I hope that this is going to be a 20 to 40
chapter mini arc, similar to zou, before we

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:11.770
hopefully move on to Elbaf.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:15.980
And we really need to find out more about
Imu and their incredible powers.

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:20.610
There are so many cool options for a overpowered
devil fruit that they could wield.

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:26.080
If you are curious which ones, then make sure
to check out that video right here or my discussion

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:31.020
of the last chapter here.

